{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>You shall not take vengeance and you shall not bear a grudge.</b> It is explained in the words of the Rabbis." "<b>And you shall love your neighbor.</b> According to the opinion of the majority, the lamed is superfluous, like the lamed in לאבנר. And in my opinion, it is as it sounds: that one should love good for one's fellow as for oneself." "And the meaning of <b>I am YHWH.</b> is: for I am one El; I created you all."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:04.493612282Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}